<p dir="auto">We have another case where we're describing specificity, <code class="notranslate">@scope</code> and <code class="notranslate">&amp;</code>. Removing the duplication and pointing to browser compat (depends on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3371832100" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27723" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27723/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27723">mdn/browser-compat-data#27723</a>).</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">We have conflicting info, specs are updated and it looks like Fx142 is the only browser to make default behavior spec-compliant.</p>
